{"id":"06f27abe4d7ff714","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"原子公式","display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["56-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","depends_on":["[[56-df-term]]","[[56-df-first-order-language]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" href=\"?note=2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" title=\"56-df-term\">56-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"23afff2411185eaa\" href=\"?note=23afff2411185eaa\" title=\"56-df-first-order-language\">56-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\">\\(L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23afff2411185eaa\" href=\"?note=23afff2411185eaa\" title=\"56-df-first-order-language\">56-df-first-order-language</a> 的语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" href=\"?note=2dc1cdb8cd43b80e\" title=\"56-df-term\">56-df-term</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为任意集合编码的表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 为有序对；有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 的分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t_i\">\\(\\vec t_i\\)</span>，空序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。关系符号及其输入在各断言内有界量化，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_L=\\varnothing\">\\(P_L=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\langle0,(s,t)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\langle0,(s,t)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\nP(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\coloneqq\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\nP(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\coloneqq\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{(s\\doteq t):s,t\\in T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{(s\\doteq t):s,t\\in T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle:P\\in P_L,\\ \\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RelFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle:P\\in P_L,\\ \\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\cup\\mathrm{RelFml}_L,\\qquad \\mathrm{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AtFml}_L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\cup\\mathrm{RelFml}_L,\\qquad \\mathrm{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零元关系符号也允许，输入是空元组。原书等式语法见 §7.1；关系原子为既有通用逻辑链的本地辅助扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"23afff2411185eaa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"23afff2411185eaa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的语言，$T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-term]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)$ 为 [[56-df-first-order-language]] 的语言，$T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-term]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L=(\\Sigma_L,P_L,\\mathrm{ar}_P)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathrm{Term}_L=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_L,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t_i","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"P_L=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"(s\\doteq t)\\coloneqq\\langle0,(s,t)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in P_L\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\;\nP(\\vec t_1,\\ldots,\\vec t_{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)})\\coloneqq\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{(s\\doteq t):s,t\\in T\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelFml}_L\\coloneqq\\{\\langle1,(P,\\vec t)\\rangle:P\\in P_L,\\ \\vec t\\in T^{\\mathrm{ar}_P(P)}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_L\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EqFml}_L\\cup\\mathrm{RelFml}_L,\\qquad \\mathrm{Atomic}_L(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_L.","display":true}],"bytes":1650,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c94545e8fa521ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 $L,\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L$，见 [[56-df-atomic-formula]]；原子构造器的外层标签分别为 $0,1$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-atomic-formula.md]]"}],"outgoing":["2dc1cdb8cd43b80e","23afff2411185eaa"]}